**********Extracted claims**********

Grab-n-Go is the first wearable device that uses active acoustic sensing to recognize subtle hand microgestures while users hold various objects.
Grab-n-Go captures information about hand microgestures, grasping poses, and object geometries simultaneously.
Grab-n-Go utilizes a single wristband for sensing.
