The deployed TrajSV system is used in a real sports video search engine.
The deployed TrajSV system is the first industry system of its kind.
Sports analytics has received significant attention from both academia and industry.
Significant amounts of data can be gathered from sports events with advancements in high-resolution cameras and sensors.
Sports data analysis can uncover valuable insights for sports application scenarios, including coaching and broadcasting.
